# publish_check.allow - hits tools/publish_check.sh lets through, each for one file and
# one kind, by a digest of exactly the strings found there (the strings are not written
# here). A changed or added string changes the digest and is reported again.
# Site values and lab addresses can never be allowed.
# Format: path<TAB>kind<TAB>digest<TAB>why
#
# Upstream Cowrie (ddd97e97) as it ships, untouched by the Cowrie teammate's patch
# (checked against changes.patch, 2026-10-16): its sample users' home folders (in its
# docs, its tests and its fake filesystem) and the fake
# /etc/shadow inside its fake filesystem. Public upstream data, not ours.
